  "releaseNotes": "3.2.0\n\n- Performance: Optimized Values enumeration, added span-based TryGetSpan retrieval, and batched RemoveRange processing\n- Testing: Added four FsCheck/NUnit property tests and BenchmarkDotNet remove-range regression benchmarks\n- Coverage: Fresh all-TFM run reports 97.28% line, 94.56% branch, and 98.94% method coverage\n- Tests: 9,752 executions across net11.0, net10.0, net9.0, and net8.0 with zero failures\n- Documentation: Updated README, testing, benchmarks, release notes, badges, and Review documentation\n\nSee the full Release Notes history: https://github.com/TigoS/MultiMap/blob/master/Docs/ReleaseNotes.md",
